{
  "_readme": "Shared browser/Worker attachment classification contract. Both frontend/src/components/chat/attachments.test.ts and backend/internal/worker/agent/attachments_test.go replay these bytes. Data is base64 so malformed UTF-8 and NUL survive JSON unchanged. Text permits valid UTF-8, TAB/LF/FF/CR and ANSI ESC, but rejects every other C0 byte and DEL. Supplied specific MIME wins; missing or generic MIME uses known filename extensions, then conservative UTF-8 text inference. Native image/PDF kind selection is not a claim that these sample bytes are a valid media document.",
